        "original_id": "e6517115-e023-5aa5-ab71-9323d9e23c25",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Brunacini\n- Organizations: Bona Terra Farms, Comair Flight 5191, Blue Grass Airport\n- Places: Lexington, Fayette County, Kentucky\n- Topics: Flower Alley\n\nFacts:\n- George Brunacini bred Flower Alley at Bona Terra Farms.\n- George Brunacini was killed in the August 27, 2006 crash of Comair Flight 5191 at Blue Grass Airport in Lexington, Kentucky.\n- Blue Grass Airport is a public airport in Fayette County, Kentucky.\n- Blue Grass Airport is 4 miles west of downtown Lexington.\n- Blue Grass Airport has the codes IATA LEX, ICAO KLEX, and FAA LID LEX.",
